# Stripe — REQUIRED for the payment system
# 1. Create a Stripe account at https://dashboard.stripe.com
# 2. Copy your "Secret key" (sk_live_... or sk_test_...) and paste below.
# 3. For the one-click cart checkout, also set NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY.
#
# Example:
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
